## Why This Is Asked

This tests practical transfer learning on small data, calibration awareness, and a simple data-collection loop.

## Key Concepts

- Transfer learning with lightweight nets
- Data augmentation for small datasets
- Probability calibration (temperature scaling)
- Active/incremental labeling
- Evaluation: accuracy and calibration metrics

## Code Example
